   "titulo": "Ask",
   "texto": [
    "To ask for something: thing + **を ください** (give me) or, more educated, **を おねがいします** (please). **メニュー を ください** (give me the letter).",
    "When you enter any shop or restaurant they will tell you **いらっしゃいませ** (welcome). You don't have to answer.",
    "To call the waiter: **すみません**."
   ]
